# Generated-output trust boundary:
#   public/** is intentionally tracked and is the ONLY generated surface intended for unattended commits.
#   Static script/schema/data/docs are normal reviewed source content and are not governed by this generated-output rule.

# Private/debug evidence and vendor artifacts are never generated-output commit targets.
private/
evidence/
work/

# Runtime staging is never committed. The generated commit-safe surface is public/.
inventory/**
!inventory/.gitkeep
reports/amd-chipset-driver-history.md
reports/amd-chipset-windows-server-compatibility.md
reports/releases/

# public/** is intentionally NOT ignored; automation may stage this directory explicitly after validation.
